  "reference": "Yoshua 8",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOS 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan Yoshuani jed'e, askarti ch'ufa fud'ad'i, dira Ai d'aqi. Sodaatte garaa ilaafini; anati jabeenna sii kenna, aka atini hayyu Aitifi nama isaatiifi dira isaale dabsate, lafti sunini tante taatu si tolcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuma atini Yerikofi hayyu isaa tolchite dira Aitifi hayyu isaale tolchi, ammo maro tana loonifi waan worri qabu ch'ufa boojia. Dira duddaduubani gaadi had'i.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba Yoshuani askarti isaa ch'ufa woliini dira Ai d'aqisa kurfefate. Inni askarti isaa nama kuma sodoma dadansa halkaniini erge ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waan jed'eeni, Dira gama kaaniti d'okhad'a, ammo iraa infagaatina; had'iisa kurfefad'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anaafi jari kiyya dirati gad'umna. Duuba yo worri Ai nuti gad'ufe, nu gargalle orina, akuma qara taane kaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri haga nu dira keesaa baanuti nu reeba, waan nu aka gaafa qara kaani nu worra baqannu seha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba isani fulla iti d'okhatani gabaattani dira worra qabdani. AABBO Waaqi keesani dira isanii kenna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi dira suni fud'attani, Akuma AABBO Waaqi jed'e kaani, guba, wonti isani tolchu maltani sunuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Yoshuani fulla iti d'okhataniti, ta Ai ila adu, ta jiddu Aitifi Betheli, worra erge achiti eega jed'eeni. Ammo Yoshuani halkani suni olla keesa bule.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boriyyaate ganama Yoshuani lafaa kae, askarti isaa ch'ufa wolti yaame, isaafi jaaroleeni Israeli haga Ai worra gussite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaafi askartini isaa yaate fullo guddo diraani seenani mirgati qubate, duuba fulla worri jiru sunifi Ai baleeti jiddu jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni askarti kuma shani fuud'e, fulla iti d'okhatani, ta diraani ila adu, jiddu Aifi Betheli geese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba askarti fulla bulto guddo ta diraani mirga had'iisa kurfeesani, askarti haga gari diraani ila aduu lakisani. Yoshuani halkani suni balee keesa bule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyuuni Ai askarti tana arginaani, isaafi nami isaa ch'ufti hurrisani ganama gabahani, gara bale Yordani d'aqani, aka askarti Israelitini wolhad'ani. Ammo inni aka askarti d'ibiini dudda duubani d'okhate worra isaa eegachuti jirtu quba inqabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuafi askartini isaa aka waan baqatani ufi tolchani lafa gamoojiti oriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba nama dira Ai keesa jiru ch'ufa wolti yaamani aka worra Yoshua reebani, ammalle reebu suni keesa dira iraa guddo fagaatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami dira keesa jiru tokoleeni inhamne dira adiyyo lakisani worra Israeli reebani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani AABBO Waaqi waan Yoshuani jed'e, Woraana kanke gara dira Ai qabi, anini dira suni sii kenna. Duuba Yoshuani woraana ufi gara dira Ai suni qabe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akuma inni harka olfud'ateeni worri qara d'okhate eegu jiru kaani orie, dira seene dabsate maro tokotu gube. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba yo worri Ai kaani ufi duuba millate aara dira isaani keesa olbahu argani, ammalle worri Israeli ka gara gamooji baqate kaaleeni fuula worraa keesa deebie, worri Ai kaani gara baqatu d'abe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuafi askartini isaa aka askartini worra ta gari dira Ai fud'ate gubde arginaani, worrileeni deebie askarti Ai ch'ufa hobaase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Askartini Israeli taani, ta dira dabsateleeni, iti ga d'ufte, worra Ai kaani gama ch'ufaani marsani bahu d'owani, ch'ufa fit'ani fiiga d'owani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hayyu worra ch'alla jira qabani Yoshuatini d'ufani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli nyaapa ufi ka haga lafa gamoojiti reebe kaani goraadeeni fit'e. Jennaani dira Aiti deebiani, nama dira suni keesati hafele ch'ufa goraadeeni hobaasani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami dira Ai ka guyya suni hobae, d'iiraafi nad'eenileeni wolti nama kunki kud'ani lama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti akanatiifi Yoshuani haga nama dira suni keesa jiru ch'ufa balleesani fit'aniti, woraani inni gara dira suni qabe kaani gadi indeefanne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli loonifi waan d'ibile ka dira suni keesaa boojie, akuma AABBO Waaqi Yoshuani jed'e, fud'ate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanaani Yoshuani Ai gube daara tolche haga arrale oni sunini akasuma jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni hayyu Aile mukhati fannise, reefa isaa haga aduuni d'ituti achumati lakise. Aduuni d'iinaani Yoshuani, Reefa arti fuud'a jed'e, duuba arti fuud'ani fullo keesa buusani d'akha irati tuulani d'akhaani sunini haga arrale achuma jira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
